Data used by these features (not part of this software's license):

- DeArrow (Sources/DeArrow.m): titles and thumbnails come from the SponsorBlock service (https://sponsor.ajay.app,
  https://dearrow.ajay.app), whose data is licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
- AiSList (Sources/AiSList.m): the blocklist and warnlist from https://aisloplist.com, maintained by the AiSList
  community at https://github.com/Override92/AiSList and licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0. They are downloaded unmodified
  and only read to match channels in the feed and search.
